@SpendWise_HostAddress = http://localhost:5159

### Public ping
GET {{SpendWise_HostAddress}}/api/ping
Accept: application/json

### Health check
GET {{SpendWise_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Development user login
POST {{SpendWise_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: vi-VN

{
  "identifier": "minhanh@spendwise.local",
  "password": "Demo@12345",
  "deviceName": "SpendWise.http"
}
